name: sim.exportIk
description:  Exports the kinematics content of a scene. The generated file can be used with the Coppelia kinematics routines, to do kinematics computations in a stand-alone application.
luaSynopsis: int result=sim.exportIk(string pathAndFilename)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. pathAndFilename: the location and the name of the file to create.
2. reserved1: reserved argument, keep at 0.
3. reserved2: reserved argument, keep at nullptr.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. 1 if operation was successful.
